{"seq":3,"slug":"building-energy-balance","title":"建筑能量平衡与能耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/building-energy-balance","wordCount":1333,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"建筑能量平衡与能耗\">建筑能量平衡与能耗</h1><p>供暖账单不会撒谎：它是一栋楼一整年所有得热与失热相抵后，必须由设备补足的那部分能量的货币化。前两篇分别讲了热量怎样穿过围护结构、人需要什么样的热环境；本篇把它们加总成一笔总账——把每一项得热和失热列进能量平衡方程，算出负荷、能耗，最终落到节能标准与碳排放。这是从&quot;局部物理&quot;走向&quot;整栋楼性能&quot;的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-建筑能量平衡方程\">核心概念：建筑能量平衡方程</h2><p>任意时刻，房间的得热与失热之差，等于需要由供暖或空调系统承担的负荷。把所有热流项写进守恒方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{HVAC} = (Q_{trans} + Q_{vent}) - (Q_{sol} + Q_{int}) + Q_{store}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtig